strings.en:
Don't give up! Let's try again! I'm sure it'll
be okay.
{wait}

strings.jp:
ちょっと焦りすぎたわ・・・
でも次はやれる！
{wait}

strings.en:
I rushed things a bit too much... But next
time, I can do it!
{wait}

It's all right. I'm sure it'll go well next time. My
hunches are always right.
{wait}

strings.jp:
なーに、もう一回やってみるさ。
案外、あっさり勝てるかもしれないよ。
{wait}

strings.en:
Hey, just give it another shot. You might win
easier than you think.
{wait}

strings.jp:
もっと慎重にやんなきゃね。
人のこと言えないけど・・・。
{wait}

strings.en:
We've gotta be more careful. Not that I'm
one to talk...
{wait}

strings.jp:
終わったの・・・？
でも・・・まだ・・・！
{wait}

やっぱり戦うの怖いよ。
でもあたし、がんばるから！
{wait}

strings.en:
Fighting really is scary. But I'll keep trying
my best!
{wait}

strings.jp:
あーら、まだやる気？
死んじゃっても知らないわよ？
{wait}

strings.en:
Oh my~, still wanna play? Don't blame me if
you end up dead~
{wait}

You still mean to defy us? It's useless... You
just don't understand, do you?
{wait}

Man, they got us good. Just charging in won't
cut it, huh? Lesson learned, lesson learned.
{wait}

strings.jp:
戦略ミス？　私もまだまだね・・・
みんな、もう一度きたえ直すわよ！
{wait}

ヒーローの魂は不撓不屈！
くじけずがんばるですっ！
{wait}

strings.en:
A hero's spirit never bends and never breaks!
We will not lose heart, yes indeed!
{wait}

strings.jp:
そんなに落ち込まないで・・・
もっと強くならなきゃ、ね？
{wait}

strings.en:
Don't be so down... We just have to get
stronger, right?
{wait}

No wa-ay, what are you all doi-ing~? Get it
together alrea-ady~ ...Huh, me?
{wait}

How come...? Well, don't let it get you down.
Let's give it one more shot.
{wait}

A loss is a loss... But to get beaten by gu-uys
like that! It makes me so ma-ad~
{wait}

strings.jp:
ここは少し休んだほうがいい。
ヤツらとの戦い、先は長いからな。
{wait}

strings.en:
We'd better rest a little. The fight against
them is a long one.
{wait}

I thought you would have a bit more
backbone.
{wait}

Ahahaha! Did you really think you could beat
me? The great Kagami-sama? Ahahahaha!
{wait}

strings.jp:
私の見込み違いだったのか？
もう少しできると思ったがな。
{wait}

strings.en:
Was I wrong about you? I thought you could
do a little better.
{wait}

strings.jp:
何度でも、はい上がるのだ。
あきらめることなど、この私が許さん！
{wait}

strings.en:
Climb back up, as many times as it takes. I will
not allow you to give up!
{wait}
